  in (((((((((sh0`{} c0) ^`{[10 * 't][64]} (sh1`{} c1)) ^`{[10 * 't][64]} (sh2`{} c2)) ^`{[10 * 't][64]} (sh3`{} c3)) ^`{[10 * 't][64]} (sh4`{} c4)) ^`{[10 * 't][64]} (sh5`{} c5)) ^`{[10 * 't][64]} (sh6`{} c6)) ^`{[10 * 't][64]} (sh7`{} c7)) ^`{[10 * 't][64]} (sh8`{} c8))"

